            <ArticleTitle>A hybrid neural network system for pattern classification tasks with missing features.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>648-53</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A hybrid neural network comprising Fuzzy ARTMAP and Fuzzy C-Means Clustering is proposed for pattern classification with incomplete training and test data. Two benchmark problems and a real medical pattern classification task are employed to evaluate the effectiveness of the hybrid network. The results are analyzed and compared with those from other methods.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
